# ── Wails packaging assets (must be committed) ───────────────────────────────
# The generic `build/` rule above is for Python artifacts, but it also swallowed
# antra-wails/build — which is where Wails reads the app icon and the macOS
# Info.plist from. appicon.png and windows/icon.ico only survived because they
# were force-added; anything new (build/darwin, build/linux) was silently never
# committed, so CI built macOS/Linux with Wails' DEFAULT icon.
!antra-wails/build/
antra-wails/build/*
!antra-wails/build/appicon.png
!antra-wails/build/README.md
!antra-wails/build/darwin/
!antra-wails/build/linux/
!antra-wails/build/windows/
antra-wails/build/windows/*
!antra-wails/build/windows/icon.ico
!antra-wails/build/windows/info.json
!antra-wails/build/windows/wails.exe.manifest

# ── v1.1.8 additions ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
